rel="noopener noreferrer">من</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">المعلومات</a></p>`},as:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googleৰ চৰ্তাৱলী</a> আৰু <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ব্যৱহাৰৰ নীতি</a> প্ৰযোজ্য। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">গোপনীয়তাৰ জাননী</a>য়ে আপোনাৰ ডেটা কিদৰে পৰিচালনা কৰা হয় সেয়া বৰ্ণনা কৰে। আপোনাৰ বাৰ্তালাপ আৰু ক’ডসমূহ পৰ্যালোচনা কৰা হ’ব পাৰে আৰু সেয়া Google AI উন্নত কৰিবলৈ ব্যৱহাৰ কৰা হ’ব পাৰে। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">আপোনাৰ পচন্দসমূহৰ বিষয়ে জানক</a>। Stitchএ ভুল কৰিব পাৰে, সেয়ে এয়া পুনৰ পৰীক্ষা কৰক আৰু <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ক’ড সাৱধানে ব্যৱহাৰ কৰক</a>।</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI মডেলসমূহক প্ৰশিক্ষণ দিবলৈ দিয়ক`,settingsBody:`<p>Googleক ইয়াৰ Generative AI মডেলসমূহক প্ৰশিক্ষণ দিবৰ বাবে আপোনাৰ ভৱিষ্যতৰ Stitchৰ বাৰ্তালাপ ব্যৱহাৰ কৰিবলৈ দিয়ক। আপুনি দিবলৈ বাছনি কৰা যিকোনো মতামতৰ ক্ষেত্ৰত অপ্ট আউট কৰাটো প্ৰযোজ্য নহয়। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">অধিক জানক</a>।</p>`},bg:{banner:`<p>Прилагат се <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Условията на Google</a> и <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">правилата относно използването</a>. В <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Съобщението за поверителност</a> е описано как се обработват данните ви. Вашите разговори и код може да бъдат преглеждани и да се използват за подобряване на AI на Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Научете повече за опциите за избор</a>. Stitch може да допуска грешки, затова проверявайте повторно и <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">използвайте кода внимателно</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Разрешаване на обучението на моделите на AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Разрешете на Google да използва бъдещите ви разговори в Stitch с цел обучение на моделите си на генеративен AI. Отказът не се отнася за отзивите, които изпратите. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Научете повече</a>.</p>`},bn:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google-এর শর্তাবলী</a> এবং <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ব্যবহার সংক্রান্ত নীতি</a> প্রযোজ্য। আপনার ডেটা কীভাবে ম্যানেজ করা হয় তা <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">গোপনীয়তা বিজ্ঞপ্তি</a> থেকে জানতে পারবেন। Google AI উন্নত করার জন্য আপনার কথোপকথন ও কোড পর্যালোচনা এবং ব্যবহার করা হতে পারে। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">আপনার পছন্দ সম্পর্কে জানুন</a>। Stitch ভুল করতে পারে, তাই ডবল-চেক করুন এবং <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">কোড ব্যবহার করার সময় সাবধানতা অবলম্বন করুন</a>।</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI মডেল ট্রেনিংয়ে ব্যবহারের অনুমতি দিন`,settingsBody:`<p>Google-এর জেনারেটিভ AI মডেল ট্রেনিংয়ের জন্য, Stitch-এ আপনার ভবিষ্যতের কথোপকথন ব্যবহার করার অনুমতি দিন। আপনি তথ্য শেয়ারের সেটিংস বন্ধ করলেও যেসব মতামত জমা দেবেন সেগুলির তথ্য ব্যবহার করা হবে। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">আরও জানুন</a>।</p>`},ca:{banner:`<p>S'hi apliquen les <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">condicions de Google</a> i la <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">política d'usos</a>. L'<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">avís de privadesa</a> descriu com es gestionen les teves dades. Les teves converses i el teu codi es podrien revisar i utilitzar per millorar la IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Obtén informació sobre les teves opcions</a>. Stitch pot cometre errors, així que comprova'n els resultats i <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">utilitza el codi amb precaució</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permet l'entrenament dels models d'IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Permet que Google utilitzi les teves converses futures amb Stitch per entrenar els seus models d'IA generativa. La desactivació d'aquesta opció no s'aplica als suggeriments que decideixis proporcionar. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Obtén més informació</a>.</p>`},cs:{banner:`<p>Platí <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">smluvní podmínky společnosti Google</a> a\xA0<a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">zásady užívání</a>. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upozornění ve věci ochrany soukromí</a> popisuje, jak zpracováváme vaše data. Vaše konverzace a\xA0kód mohou být zkontrolovány a\xA0využity k\xA0vylepšování Google AI. Přečtěte si <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">další informace o\xA0tom, jaké máte možnosti volby</a>. Stitch může dělat chyby, takže si všechno kontrolujte a\xA0<a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kód používejte s\xA0rozvahou</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Povolit trénování modelů umělé inteligence`,settingsBody:`<p>Nechat Google používat budoucí konverzace se službou Stitch k\xA0trénování modelů generativní umělé inteligence. Odhlášení se nevztahuje na případnou vámi poskytnutou zpětnou vazbu. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Další informace</a></p>`},da:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googles servicevilkår</a> samt <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Anvendelsespolitik</a> er gældende. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privatlivsmeddelelsen</a> beskriver, hvordan dine data håndteres. Dine samtaler og din kode kan blive gennemgået og brugt til at forbedre Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lær om dine valgmuligheder </a>. Stitch kan lave fejl, så tjek det grundigt og <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">brug kode med forsigtighed </a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Tillad AI-modeltræning`,settingsBody:`<p>Lad Google bruge dine fremtidige Stitch-samtaler til at træne sine generativ AI-modeller. Fravalg gælder ikke for feedback, du selv måtte vælge at give. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Få flere oplysninger</a>.</p>`},de:{banner:`<p>Es gelten die <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google-Nutzungsbedingungen</a> und die <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Richtlinie zur unzulässigen Nutzung von generativer\xA0KI</a>. In den <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Datenschutzhinweisen</a> wird die Verwendung Ihrer Daten beschrieben. Ihre Unterhaltungen und Ihr Code werden möglicherweise von Prüfern angesehen und können zur Verbesserung von Google\xA0AI verwendet werden. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Hier erfahren Sie mehr über Ihre Auswahlmöglichkeiten</a>. Stitch kann Fehler machen, überprüfen Sie daher die Antworten und <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">verwenden Sie den Code mit Vorsicht</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Trainieren von KI-Modellen erlauben`,settingsBody:`<p>Sie können Google erlauben, zukünftige Unterhaltungen in Stitch zum Trainieren seiner generativen\xA0KI-Modelle zu verwenden. Feedback, das Sie geben, kann immer zu diesem Zweck verwendet werden\xA0– auch wenn die Option deaktiviert ist. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Weitere Informationen</a></p>`},el:{banner:`<p>Ισχύουν οι <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Όροι</a> και η <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Πολιτική χρήσης</a> της Google. Η <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Σημείωση απορρήτου</a> περιγράφει τον τρόπο διαχείρισης των δεδομένων σας. Οι συνομιλίες και ο κώδικάς σας ενδέχεται να ελεγχθούν και να χρησιμοποιηθούν για τη βελτίωση του Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Μάθετε σχετικά με τις επιλογές σας</a>. Το Stitch μπορεί να κάνει λάθη, επομένως θα πρέπει να επαληθεύετε τις απαντήσεις του και <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">να χρησιμοποιείτε τον κώδικα με προσοχή</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Να επιτρέπεται η εκπαίδευση μοντέλων AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Επιτρέψτε στην Google να χρησιμοποιεί μελλοντικές συνομιλίες από το Stitch για την εκπαίδευση των generative μοντέλων AI. Η εξαίρεση από την εν λόγω χρήση δεν καλύπτει τυχόν σχόλια που επιλέγετε να παράσχετε. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Μάθετε περισσότερα</a>.</p>`},"en-GB":{banner:`<p>The <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Terms</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Use Policy</a> apply. The <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Notice</a> describes how your data is handled. Your conversations and code may be reviewed and used to improve Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn about your choices</a>. Stitch can make mistakes, so double-check it and <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">use code with caution</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Allow AI model training`,settingsBody:`<p>Let Google use your future Stitch conversations to train its generative AI models. Opting out does not apply to any feedback that you may choose to provide. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more</a>.</p>`},"en-IN":{banner:`<p>The <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Terms</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Use Policy</a> apply. The <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Notice</a> describes how your data is handled. Your conversations and code may be reviewed and used to improve Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn about your choices</a>. Stitch can make mistakes, so double-check it and <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">use code with caution</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Allow AI Model Training`,settingsBody:`<p>Let Google use your future Stitch conversations to train its generative AI models. Opting out does not apply to any feedback you may choose to provide. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more</a>.</p>`},"es-419":{banner:`<p>Se aplican las <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Condiciones</a> y la <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Política de Uso de Google</a>. En el <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aviso de Privacidad</a>, se describe cómo se manejan sus datos. Es posible que sus conversaciones y código se revisen y usen para mejorar la IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Obtenga más información sobre sus elecciones</a>. Stitch puede cometer errores, así que verifique y <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">use el código con precaución</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permita el entrenamiento de modelos de IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Permita que Google utilice sus conversaciones futuras con Stitch para entrenar sus modelos de IA generativa. Si elige no proporcionar sus datos, esto no se aplica para los comentarios que decida enviar. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Obtenga más información</a>.</p>`},es:{banner:`<p>Se aplican los <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Términos de Google</a> y la <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Política de Usos</a>. En el <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aviso de Privacidad</a> se describe cómo se tratan tus datos. Las conversaciones y el código se pueden revisar y usar para mejorar la IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Consulta información sobre tus opciones</a>. Stitch puede cometer errores, así que comprueba sus respuestas y <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">usa el código con precaución</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permitir el entrenamiento de modelos de IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Permite que Google use tus futuras conversaciones de Stitch para entrenar sus modelos de IA generativa. Aunque inhabilites la opción, se seguirán usando los comentarios que decidas enviarnos. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Más información</a></p>`},et:{banner:`<p>Kehtivad <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google'i tingimused</a> ja <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kasutusreeglid</a>. Teie teabe töötlemist kirjeldatakse <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">privaatsusteatises</a>. Teie vestlusi ja koodi võidakse üle vaadata ning kasutada Google'i AI täiustamiseks. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vaadake teavet oma valikute kohta</a>. Stitch võib eksida, nii et kontrollige selle vastused üle ja <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">olge koodi kasutamisel ettevaatlik</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI-mudeli treenimise lubamine`,settingsBody:`<p>Lubage Google'il kasutada teie tulevasi Stitchi vestlusi Google'i generatiivse AI mudelite treenimiseks. Loobumine ei kehti tagasiside puhul, mida võite esitada. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Vaadake lisateavet</a>.</p>`},eu:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google-ren Baldintzak</a> eta <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Erabilera-gidalerroak</a> aplikatzen dira. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pribatutasun-oharrak</a> azaltzen du datuak nola kudeatzen diren. Baliteke elkarrizketak eta kodea berrikustea eta Google-ren AA hobetzeko erabiltzea. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lortu zure aukerei buruzko informazioa</a>. Baliteke Stitch-ek akatsak egitea. Beraz, egiazta ezazu eta <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">erabili kodea kontu handiz</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Eman AAko ereduak trebatzeko baimena`,settingsBody:`<p>Eman Stitch-eko etorkizuneko elkarrizketak erabiltzeko baimena Google-ri, AAko eredu generatiboak trebatzeko. Ez erabiltzea aukeratzen baduzu ere, bidaltzen dituzun oharrak erabili ahalko dira. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Lortu informazio gehiago</a>.</p>`},fa:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">شرایط</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">خدمات</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google</a> و <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">خط</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="