al/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">از</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">کد</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">بااحتیاط</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">استفاده</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">کنید</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`مجاز کردن آموزش مدل هوش مصنوعی`,settingsBody:`<p>به Google اجازه داده می‌شود از مکالمه‌های آتی شما با Stitch برای آموزش مدل‌های هوش مصنوعی زایای خود استفاده کند. انصراف دادن شامل بازخوردهایی که ممکن است ارائه دهید نمی‌شود. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">بیشتر</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">بدانید</a>.</p>`},fi:{banner:`<p>Nalalapat ang <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mga Tuntunin ng Google</a> at <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Patakaran sa Paggamit</a>. Inilalarawan ng <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Notification ng Privacy</a> kung paano pinapangasiwaan ang data mo. Posibleng suriin at gamitin ang iyong mga pag-uusap at code para mapahusay ang Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Alamin ang tungkol sa iyong mga pagpipilian</a>. Posibleng magkamali ang Stitch, kaya i-double check ito at <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">gamitin ang code nang may pag-iingat</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Payagan ang Pagsasanay ng AI Model`,settingsBody:`<p>Payagan ang Google na gamitin ang mga pag-uusap mo sa Stitch sa hinaharap para sanayin ang mga generative AI model nito. Kapag nag-opt out ka, hindi ito malalapat sa anumang feedback na posibleng piliin mong ibigay. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Matuto pa</a>.</p>`},"fr-CA":{banner:`<p>Les <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">conditions de Google</a> et la <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">politique d'utilisation interdite</a> s'appliquent. L'<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">avis de confidentialité</a> décrit la façon dont vos données sont traitées. Vos conversations et votre code peuvent être examinés et utilisés pour améliorer l'IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apprenez-en plus sur vos choix.</a> Stitch peut faire des erreurs, alors vérifiez-le bien et <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">utilisez le code avec prudence</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Autoriser l'entraînement de modèles d'IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Laissez Google utiliser vos futures conversations Stitch pour entraîner ses modèles d'IA générative. Votre refus ne s'applique pas aux commentaires que vous pouvez choisir de fournir. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Apprenez-en plus.</a></p>`},fr:{banner:`<p>Les <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Conditions d'utilisation de Google</a> et le <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Règlement sur l'utilisation</a> s'appliquent. L'<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Avis de confidentialité</a> explique comment vos données sont traitées. Vos conversations et votre code peuvent être examinés et utilisés pour améliorer l'IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Découvrez les options qui s'offrent à vous.</a> Stitch peut faire des erreurs, vérifiez ses réponses et <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">utilisez son code avec précaution</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Autoriser l'entraînement de modèles d'IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Autoriser Google à utiliser vos futures conversations avec Stitch afin d'entraîner ses modèles d'IA générative. Votre refus ne s'applique pas aux éventuels commentaires que vous pourriez choisir d'envoyer. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">En savoir plus</a></p>`},ga:{banner:`<p>Tá feidhm ag <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Téarmaí Google</a> agus ag an <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Polasaí Úsáidte</a>. Déantar cur síos san <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Fhógra Príobháideachais</a> ar an gcaoi a láimhseáiltear do shonraí. D'fhéadfadh do chomhráite agus do chód a athbhreithniú agus iad a úsáid chun IS Google a fheabhsú. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Faigh amach faoi do roghanna</a>. Is féidir le Stitch botúin a dhéanamh, mar sin seiceáil faoi dhó é agus <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">bí faichilleach le cód</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Ceadaigh Oiliúint Samhla IS`,settingsBody:`<p>Lig do Google do chomhráite Stitch amach anseo a úsáid chun a shamhlacha IS giniúnacha a oiliúint. Ní bhaineann díliostáil le haon aiseolas a d'fhéadfá a roghnú lena chur ar fáil. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tuilleadh faisnéise</a>.</p>`},gl:{banner:`<p>Aplícanse as <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Condicións de Google</a> e a <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Política de uso</a>. No <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aviso de privacidade</a> indícase como se tratan os teus datos. As túas conversas e o código poden revisarse e usarse para mellorar a IA de Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Máis información sobre as túas opcións.</a> Stitch pode cometer erros, así que verifica os resultados e <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">usa o código con precaución</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permitir adestramento de modelos de IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Permite que Google use as conversas que teñas a partir de agora en Stitch para adestrar os seus modelos de IA xenerativa. Aínda que teñas desactivada esta opción, seguiranse utilizando os comentarios que decidas enviar. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Máis información.</a></p>`},gu:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google સેવાની શરતો</a> અને <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ઉપયોગ સંબંધિત પૉલિસી</a> લાગુ થાય છે. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">પ્રાઇવસી નોટિસ</a> તમારા ડેટાને હૅન્ડલ કરવાની રીત વર્ણવે છે. તમારી વાતચીતો અને કોડનો રિવ્યૂ કરવામાં આવી શકે છે અને તેનો ઉપયોગ Google AIને બહેતર બનાવવા માટે થઈ શકે છે. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">તમારી પસંદગીઓ વિશે જાણો</a>. Stitch ભૂલો કરી શકે છે, તેથી બે વાર ચેક કરો અને <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">સાવચેતીથી કોડનો ઉપયોગ કરો</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI મૉડલના પ્રશિક્ષણની મંજૂરી આપો`,settingsBody:`<p>Googleને તેના જનરેટિવ AI મૉડલને પ્રશિક્ષિત કરવા માટે Stitchની તમારી ભાવિ વાતચીતોનો ઉપયોગ કરવાની મંજૂરી આપો. તમે આપવાનું પસંદ કર્યા હોય તેવા કોઈપણ પ્રતિસાદ પર નાપસંદ કરવાની ક્રિયા લાગુ થતી નથી. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">વધુ જાણો</a>.</p>`},hi:{banner:`<p>उपयोगकर्ताओं पर <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google की सेवा की शर्तें</a> और <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">इस्तेमाल की नीति</a> लागू होती है. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">निजता नोटिस</a> में बताया गया है कि आपके डेटा का रखरखाव और उसका इस्तेमाल कैसे किया जाता है. Google के एआई को बेहतर बनाने के लिए, आपकी बातचीत के डेटा और कोड की समीक्षा की जा सकती है. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">आपके लिए मौजूद विकल्पों के बारे में जानें</a>. Stitch से गलतियां हो सकती हैं. इसलिए, इससे मिले जवाबों की दोबारा जांच कर लें और <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">कोड का इस्तेमाल सावधानी से करें</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`एआई मॉडल को ट्रेन करने की अनुमति दें`,settingsBody:`<p>Google को अपने जनरेटिव एआई मॉडल को ट्रेन करने के लिए, आने वाले समय में Stitch पर होने वाली आपकी बातचीत के डेटा का इस्तेमाल करने की अनुमति दें. ऑप्ट आउट करने पर भी, Google आपके सुझाव, राय या शिकायत का इस्तेमाल कर सकता है. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ज़्यादा जानें</a>.</p>`},hr:{banner:`<p>Primjenjuju se <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googleovi uvjeti</a> i <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pravila o upotrebi</a>. U <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">obavijesti o privatnosti</a> opisano je na koji se način postupa s vašim podacima. Razgovori i kôd mogu se pregledati i upotrijebiti u svrhu poboljšanja Googleovog AI-ja <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saznajte više o svojim odabirima</a>. Stitch može pogriješiti, pa provjerite <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">i upotrijebite kôd s oprezom</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Dopusti obuku AI modela`,settingsBody:`<p>Neka Google upotrebljava vaše buduće razgovore povezane sa Stitchem za obuku svojih generativnih AI modela. Isključivanje se ne odnosi na povratne informacije koje odlučite dati. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saznajte više</a>.</p>`},hu:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">A Google Feltételei</a> és <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">használati irányelvei</a> vannak érvényben. Az adatkezelés gyakorlatát az <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Adatvédelmi közlemény</a> ismerteti. Beszélgetéseit és kódjait felülvizsgálhatjuk, és felhasználhatjuk a Google AI továbbfejlesztésére. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">További információ a választási lehetőségeiről</a>. A Stitch hibázhat, ezért ellenőrizze a válaszait, és <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">legyen körültekintő a kódok felhasználásakor</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI-modell betanításának engedélyezése`,settingsBody:`<p>Engedélyezheti a Google-nak a jövőbeli Stitch-beszélgetéseinek a generatív AI-modelljeinek betanítására való felhasználását. Az adatok megosztásának elutasítása nem vonatkozik az Ön által adott visszajelzésekre. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">További információ</a>.</p>`},id:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Persyaratan Google</a> dan <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kebijakan Penggunaan</a> berlaku. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pemberitahuan Privasi</a> berisi penjelasan mengenai cara penanganan data Anda. Percakapan dan kode Anda mungkin akan ditinjau dan digunakan untuk meningkatkan kualitas AI Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pelajari pilihan Anda</a>. Stitch dapat membuat kesalahan, jadi sebaiknya periksa kembali dan <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">gunakan kode dengan hati-hati</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Izinkan Pelatihan Model AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Izinkan Google menggunakan percakapan mendatang Anda di Stitch untuk melatih model AI generatif. Pilihan tidak ikut tidak berlaku untuk masukan apa pun yang mungkin Anda berikan. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Pelajari lebih lanjut</a>.</p>`},is:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Skilmálar</a> og <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">notkunarreglur</a> Google eiga við. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Upplýsingar um persónuvernd</a> lýsa því hvernig gögnin þín eru meðhöndluð. Hugsanlega verður farið yfir samtölin þín og kóða í því skyni að bæta gervigreind Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nánar um val þitt</a>. Stitch getur gert mistök svo að þú skalt fara yfir öll svör og <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nota kóða af varfærni</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Leyfa þjálfun gervigreindarlíkana`,settingsBody:`<p>Leyfðu Google að nota samtölin þín í Stitch héðan í frá til að þjálfa skapandi gervigreindarlíkön sín. Afþökkun gildir ekki um ábendingar sem þú gætir veitt. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Nánar</a>.</p>`},it:{banner:`<p>Si applicano i <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Termini Google</a> e le <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Norme sull'utilizzo</a>. L'<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Informativa sulla privacy</a> descrive le modalità del trattamento dei tuoi dati. Le tue conversazioni e il tuo codice potrebbero essere esaminati e utilizzati per migliorare Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scopri di più sulle opzioni a tua disposizione</a>. Stitch può fare errori, quindi verifica le sue risposte e <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">usa il codice con cautela</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Consenti l'addestramento dei modelli di AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Consenti a Google di utilizzare le tue conversazioni future su Stitch per addestrare i suoi modelli di AI generativa. Il ritiro del consenso non si applica a eventuali feedback che deciderai di fornire. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Scopri di più</a>.</p>`},iw:{banner:`<p>בכפוף <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">לתנאים</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">של</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google</a> ו<a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">למדיניות</a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">השימוש</a>. ב<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">הודעת</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">הפרטיות</a> מוסבר מה אנחנו עושים עם הנתונים. יכול להיות שנבדוק את הקוד והשיחות שלך ונשתמש בהם כדי לשפר את ה-AI מבית Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">כאן</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">מפורטות</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">כל</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">האפשרויות</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">שקשורות</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">לשמירת</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">נתונים</a>. ‫Stitch עלול לעשות טעויות אז חשוב לבדוק אותו טוב <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ולהשתמש</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">בקוד</a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">בזהירות</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`אישור לאימון מודלים של AI`,settingsBody:`<p>‫Google תוכל להשתמש בשיחות העתידיות ב-Stitch כדי לאמן את המודלים של ה-AI הגנרטיבי. ‫Google תוכל להשתמש במשוב של משתמשים גם אם הם יבטלו את האישור לשימוש בשיחות ובקוד לאימון המודלים. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">מידע</a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> </a><a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">נוסף</a></p>`},ja:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google 利用規約</a>と<a href="ht