se-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dasar Pengguna</a>. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Notis Privasi</a> menerangkan cara data anda dikendalikan. Perbualan dan kod anda boleh disemak dan digunakan untuk meningkatkan Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ketahui pilihan anda</a>. Stitch mungkin melakukan kesilapan, maka buat semakan semula dan <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">gunakan kod dengan berhati-hati</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Benarkan Latihan Model AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Benarkan Google menggunakan perbualan Stitch masa hadapan anda untuk melatih model AI generatif Google. Penarikan diri tidak terpakai pada sebarang maklum balas yang anda pilih untuk diberikan. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ketahui lebih lanjut</a>.</p>`},nl:{banner:`<p>De <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Servicevoorwaarden van Google</a> en het <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Beleid tegen verboden gebruik van AI</a> zijn van toepassing. In de <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacyverklaring</a> wordt beschreven hoe we omgaan met uw gegevens. Uw gesprekken en code kunnen worden beoordeeld en gebruikt om AI van Google te verbeteren. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meer informatie over uw keuzes</a>. Stitch kan fouten maken, dus dubbelcheck het en <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">wees voorzichtig met het gebruik van code</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Trainen van AI-modellen toestaan`,settingsBody:`<p>Laat Google uw toekomstige Stitch-gesprekken gebruiken om generatieve AI-modellen te trainen. Als u uw toestemming intrekt, is dit niet van toepassing op eventuele feedback die u verstrekt. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Meer informatie</a>.</p>`},no:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googles vilkår</a> og <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">retningslinjene for bruk</a> gjelder. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Merknaden om personvern</a> beskriver hvordan dataene dine håndteres. Samtalene dine og koden din kan bli gjennomgått og brukt for å gjøre AI fra Google bedre. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Finn ut mer om valgene du har</a>. Stitch kan gjøre feil, så du bør dobbeltsjekke resultatene og <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">være forsiktig når du bruker kode</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Gi tillatelse til opplæring av AI-modeller`,settingsBody:`<p>La Google bruke fremtidige samtaler med Stitch til å lære opp generative AI-modeller. Selv om du velger dette bort, kan tilbakemeldinger du eventuelt gir, fortsatt brukes. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Finn ut mer</a>.</p>`},or:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google ସେବାର ସର୍ତ୍ତାବଳୀ</a> ଏବଂ <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ବ୍ୟବହାର ନୀତି</a> ଲାଗୁ ହୁଏ। ଆପଣଙ୍କ ଡାଟାକୁ କିପରି ପରିଚାଳନା କରାଯାଏ ତାହା <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ଗୋପନୀୟତା ନୋଟିସ</a> ବର୍ଣ୍ଣନା କରେ। ଆପଣଙ୍କ ବାର୍ତ୍ତାଳାପ ଓ କୋଡକୁ ସମୀକ୍ଷା କରାଯାଇପାରେ ଏବଂ Google AI ଉନ୍ନତ କରିବାକୁ ବ୍ୟବହାର କରାଯାଇପାରେ। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ଆପଣଙ୍କ ପସନ୍ଦଗୁଡ଼ିକ ବିଷୟରେ ଜାଣନ୍ତୁ</a>। Stitch ଭୁଲ କରିପାରେ, ତେଣୁ ଏହାକୁ ଦୁଇଥର-ଯାଞ୍ଚ କରନ୍ତୁ ଏବଂ <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ସତର୍କତାର ସହ କୋଡ ବ୍ୟବହାର କରନ୍ତୁ</a>।</p>`,settingsHeader:`AI ମଡେଲ ଟ୍ରେନିଂକୁ ଅନୁମତି ଦିଅନ୍ତୁ`,settingsBody:`<p>Googleକୁ ଏହାର ଜେନେରେଟିଭ AI ମଡେଲଗୁଡ଼ିକୁ ତାଲିମ ଦେବା ପାଇଁ ଆପଣଙ୍କ ଭବିଷ୍ୟତର Stitch ବାର୍ତ୍ତାଳାପକୁ ବ୍ୟବହାର କରିବାକୁ ଦିଅନ୍ତୁ। ଆପଣ ପ୍ରଦାନ କରିବାକୁ ବାଛିଥିବା ଯେ କୌଣସି ମତାମତ ପାଇଁ ଅପ୍ଟ ଆଉଟ କରିବା ଲାଗୁ ହୁଏ ନାହିଁ। <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ଅଧିକ ଜାଣନ୍ତୁ</a>।</p>`},pl:{banner:`<p>Obowiązują <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Warunki usług Google</a> oraz <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Zasady użytkowania</a>. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Informacje na temat ochrony prywatności</a> opisują, w\xA0jaki sposób korzystamy z\xA0Twoich danych. Twoje rozmowy i\xA0kod mogą być sprawdzane i\xA0wykorzystywane do ulepszania AI od Google. Dowiedz się, <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">jaki masz wybór</a>. Stitch może popełniać błędy, więc sprawdzaj wygenerowane odpowiedzi i\xA0<a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">zachowaj ostrożność przy korzystaniu z\xA0kodu</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Zezwalaj na trenowanie modeli AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Pozwól Google na używanie Twoich przyszłych rozmów w\xA0usłudze Stitch do trenowania modeli generatywnej AI. Rezygnacja nie dotyczy przesyłanych przez Ciebie opinii. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Więcej informacji</a></p>`},"pt-BR":{banner:`<p>Os <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Termos do Google</a> e a <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Política de Uso</a> são válidos. No <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aviso de privacidade</a>, descrevemos como seus dados são gerenciados. Suas conversas e seus códigos podem ser analisados e usados para aprimorar a IA do Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saiba mais sobre suas opções</a>. O Stitch pode cometer erros. Por isso, é importante checar as respostas e <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">usar os códigos com cautela</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permitir o treinamento de modelos de IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Deixe o Google usar suas conversas futuras do Stitch para treinar os modelos de IA generativa. A desativação dessa opção não se aplica ao feedback que você envia. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saiba mais.</a></p>`},"pt-PT":{banner:`<p>Aplicam-se os <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Termos de Utilização da Google</a> e a <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Política de Utilização</a>. O <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aviso de Privacidade</a> descreve a forma como tratamos os seus dados. As suas conversas e código podem ser revistos e usados para melhorar a IA da Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saiba mais sobre as suas opções</a>. O Stitch pode cometer erros, por isso, verifique e <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">use o código com cuidado</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permitir preparação de modelos de IA`,settingsBody:`<p>Permita que a Google use as suas futuras conversas do Stitch para preparar os respetivos modelos de IA generativa. A desativação da opção não se aplica ao feedback que possa dar. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Saiba mais</a>.</p>`},ro:{banner:`<p>Se aplică <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Termenii Google</a> și <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Politica privind utilizarea</a>. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Notificarea privind confidențialitatea</a> descrie modul în care îți sunt gestionate datele. Conversațiile și codul tău pot fi examinate și folosite pentru a îmbunătăți Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Află mai multe despre ce opțiuni ai</a>. Stitch poate face greșeli, așadar verifică încă o dată și <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">folosește codul cu precauție</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Permite instruirea modelului AI`,settingsBody:`<p>Permite ca Google să-ți folosească viitoarele conversații cu Stitch pentru a instrui modelele Google de AI generativ. Renunțarea nu se aplică și feedbackului pe care alegi să-l trimiți. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Află mai multe</a>.</p>`},ru:{banner:`<p>Действуют <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Условия использования Google</a> и <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Правила в отношении запрещенного использования генеративного ИИ</a>. В <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Примечании о конфиденциальности</a> рассказано, как обрабатываются ваши данные. Мы можем проверять и использовать ваши чаты и код, чтобы улучшать искусственный интеллект от Google. Узнайте больше <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">о доступных настройках</a>. Stitch может ошибаться. Обязательно проверяйте полученные ответы и <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">сгенерированный код</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Разрешить обучение ИИ-моделей`,settingsBody:`<p>Google будет использовать будущие чаты со Stitch для обучения своих моделей генеративного ИИ. Отказ не распространяется на ваши отзывы. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Подробнее…</a></p>`},sk:{banner:`<p>Platia <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">zmluvné podmienky</a> a\xA0<a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pravidlá používania spoločnosti Google</a>. V\xA0<a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">oznámení o\xA0ochrane súkromia</a> je uvedené, ako zaobchádzame s\xA0vašimi údajmi. Vaše konverzácie a\xA0kód sa môžu kontrolovať a\xA0používať na zlepšovanie umelej inteligencie od spoločnosti Google. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aké máte možnosti</a> Služba Stitch môže robiť chyby, preto si jej odpovede overujte a\xA0<a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kód používajte uvážlivo</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Povoľovať optimalizáciu modelov umelej inteligencie`,settingsBody:`<p>Umožnite spoločnosti Google cvičiť svoje modely generatívnej umelej inteligencie pomocou vašich budúcich konverzácií v\xA0službe Stitch. Odhlásenie sa nevzťahuje na žiadnu spätnú väzbu, ktorú sa rozhodnete poskytnúť. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Ďalšie informácie</a></p>`},sl:{banner:`<p>Veljajo <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googlovi pogoji</a> in <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">pravilnik o uporabi</a>. V <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">obvestilu o zasebnosti</a> je opisano, kako ravnamo z vašimi podatki. Vaši pogovori in koda bodo morda pregledani in uporabljeni za izboljšanje Googlove umetne inteligence. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Preberite več o svojih izbirah</a>. Stitch se lahko tudi zmoti, zato preverite odgovor in <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">kodo uporabljajte previdno</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Dovoli usposabljanje modelov umetne inteligence`,settingsBody:`<p>Dovolite Googlu, da prihodnje pogovore s Stitchem uporablja za usposabljanje modelov generativne umetne inteligence. Onemogočenje ne velja za morebitne povratne informacije, ki jih posredujete. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Preberite več o tem</a>.</p>`},sr:{banner:`<p>Примењују се <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google услови</a> и <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">смернице за коришћење</a>. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Обавештење о приватности</a> описује како се поступа са подацима. Конверзације и кôд могу да се прегледају и користе за побољшање Google AI-ја. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Сазнајте више о доступним изборима</a>. Stitch може да прави грешке, па проверите резултате и <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">пажљиво користите кôд</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Дозволите обуку модела вештачке интелигенције`,settingsBody:`<p>Дозволите Google-у да користи будуће Stitch конверзације за обуку модела генеративне вештачке интелигенције. Онемогућавање ове опције неће важити за евентуалне повратне информације које одаберете да пружите. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Сазнајте више</a>.</p>`},sv:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Googles villkor</a> och<a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">användarpolicy</a> gäller. I <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">integritetsmeddelandet</a> kan du läsa om hur din data behandlas. Dina konversationer och kod kan granskas och användas för att förbättra Google AI. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/settings" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Läs mer om dina val</a>. Stitch kan göra misstag, så dubbelkolla den och <a href="https://g.co/legal/generative-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">använd kod försiktigt</a>.</p>`,settingsHeader:`Tillåt träning av AI-modell`,settingsBody:`<p>Låt Google använda dina framtida Stitch-konversationer för att träna sina generativa AI-modeller. Även om du väljer bort detta gäller det inte för eventuell feedback som du lämnar. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/legal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Läs mer</a>.</p>`},sw:{banner:`<p><a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Masharti ya Google</a> pamoja na <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms/generative-ai/use-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sera ya Matumizi </a> vinatumika. <a href="https://stitch.withgoogle.com/privacy" ta